        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Subsonic Pulse"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, primal)\n\nThe harmona beats their wings rapidly towards the ground, creating a nearly inaudible rumble and sending a wave of shaking earth to overwhelm their enemies. Each creature in a 15-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 30 basic Fortitude save or take 6d6 sonic damage. A creature that fails its save is knocked prone from the shaking ground."
            },
